---
title: "emergencyWithdraw (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: not Legion operator
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_token: authorized
    q_check_token --> q_get_balance: token address valid
    q_get_balance --> q_check_balance: balance = token.balanceOf(address(this))
    q_check_balance --> q_transfer: balance > 0
    q_check_balance --> q_revert_zero: balance == 0
    q_revert_zero --> [*]: revert NoTokensToWithdraw
    q_transfer --> q_emit: transfer token to Legion treasury
    q_emit --> [*]: emit EmergencyWithdraw(token, amount)

    note right of q_check_auth
        INV-001: Only Legion operators can emergency withdraw
        INV-002: Can withdraw any ERC20 token held by contract
        INV-003: Emergency function - bypasses normal sale lifecycle checks
    end note
